 "remarks": "Welcome to Clocktower Close! This beautifully updated first-floor studio offers the perfect blend of comfort, style, and convenience in one of Norwalk's most desirable condominium communities. Filled with natural light from oversized windows, the thoughtfully designed layout features updated stainless steel appliances, new laminate wood flooring, a smart thermostat, a spacious walk-in closet, and two additional storage closets, providing exceptional storage rarely found in a studio.  Freshly painted and move-in ready, this home is ideal for anyone seeking low-maintenance living with outstanding amenities. Residents enjoy access to a fully equipped fitness center, sauna and locker rooms, community room with full kitchen, conference/meeting room, game room with billiards, and a beautifully landscaped outdoor courtyard.  Conveniently located just minutes from South Norwalk (SoNo), the Metro-North train station, I-95, Route 7, shopping, dining, and Norwalk's vibrant waterfront, this location is perfect for commuters and anyone looking to enjoy everything the area has to offer.  Don't miss this opportunity to lease a move-in-ready home in the highly sought-after Clocktower Close community. Schedule your private showing today!",
